WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
Dave's card charged him $695 again.

2
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:08.040
Chad points to a $20 credit after an $80 purchase,

3
00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.560
but the math is simple.

4
00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:11.840
80 minus 20 is 60.

5
00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:15.200
Points monk counts only benefits Dave would have bought anyway.

6
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.120
Then he compares that real value with the annual fee.

7
00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:21.360
If the value is higher, the card may make sense.

8
00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:23.960
If the fee is higher, rethink it.

9
00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.160
Ignore the flex and keep the math.
